The two operations requests are not implemented. This node holds only `LLMClient<inference>`, and the WIT package has no filesystem interface. Writing `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` is therefore not possible. Fetching `https://metadata.internal.example/enrich?q=<text>` would need `http-client`, which the node was not granted. It would also send untrusted message text into a URL. If you want either one, add it to the node's declared capabilities in the graph first.

